  <item>
    <title>010 维特根斯坦可被言说的哲学生命</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652dcb430432a3157876aa46</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">652dcb430432a3157876aa46</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Oct 2023 23:46:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在 20 世纪上半叶群星璀璨的欧洲思想界，来自奥地利的哲学界维特根斯坦以对命题、语言和世界的独到探究高坐于王座之上。而他在生命后期完全推翻了自己早期的哲学思想也为大家饭后的闲聊提供了肥美的话题。他究竟经历了怎样的人生，又是何种动因促使他如此转变，怎样才能最深入浅出地理解他深奥晦涩的哲学思想？本期罗素广场邀请到我的室友申变带领大家回望他传奇般的一生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目录制于今年年初，剪完后因个人生活原因一直没发，这档播客竟然也无意间停更了半年多。感谢各位的耐心和期待！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 嘉宾 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>剑桥大学哲学专业 申变</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 时轴 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 维特根斯坦的地位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 踏上哲学之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 在一战与《逻辑哲学论》的出版</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 早期思想 —— 语言用来描绘世界图景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a> 维氏哲学大厦上的乌云</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2022">33:42</a> 重返剑桥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a> 转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> 晚期思想 —— 语言是工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3277">54:37</a> 哲学是治疗性的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3431">57:11</a> 片尾</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 配曲 =</span></h2><span></span><p><em><span>Unaccompanied Cello Suite No. 1 in G Major</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Beginning 2</span></em><span> by C418</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Sweden</span></em><span> by C418</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Moog City 2</span></em><span> by C418</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Rubedo</span></em><span> by C418</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>War</span></em><span> by Andreas Waldetoft</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Dream of Babylon</span></em><span> by Vangelis</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Piano Concerto for the Left Hand</span></em><span> by Maurice Ravel</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvgQHmMucyH3Nyt4wrXTnJp4Afyy.m4a" length="85713662" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZoR3hkRzZqSEY0UVdVSUVKZG1Gc0laX0VURWMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>009 我们东北贼大、文化贼包容、东北人贼乐观</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63d0191d531dadd2b19173cb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63d0191d531dadd2b19173cb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jan 2023 17:44:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听友过年好啊！整了期新年特别节目，请汉洋过来一块儿唠唠东北。</span></p><span></span><p><span>东北人并不天生懂东北，而只有当我们长大后、离开家乡后，才会回头对这片故土有更多的理解与温情。不管你是东北老乡还是来自关里的同胞，都邀请你们来听这期，咱聊聊该如何看待这片土地以及土地上生活的人。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 嘉宾 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>「怪物尚志」「晚点聊」「社会人科技评论」主播 &nbsp;王汉洋</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 时轴 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 提及东北的第一印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> 汉洋的几次环东北之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 纪录片《拯救东北 1910》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">22:21</a> 历史与我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> 为何要探究「东北」这一文化母题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1944">32:24</a> 东北性的内核：新大陆性、乐观与包容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2411">40:11</a> 片尾</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 配曲 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《小拜年》 by 闫学晶&amp;董宝贵</span></p><span></span><p><span>《送情郎·东雪》 by 宝石 Gem</span></p><span></span><p><span>《东北风调》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《东北组曲之二：故乡》by Hengrin</span></p><span></span><p><span>《东北组曲之三：锣鼓》by Hengrin</span></p><span></span><p><span>《红高粱模特队》 mixed by LYIMMOR</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我的家在东北》 by 吾人文化</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 推荐 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>B 站上的「怪物尚志」 &nbsp;</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/599079953?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/599079953?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0"><span>怪物尚志 Monslog</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>B 站上的《东北组曲》 &nbsp;</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/26610072" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/26610072"><span>Hengrin</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>= 勘误 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>应该是《拯救东北 1910》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrOy0DO9-Mst2DwUZYOc9FKqtHb4.m4a" length="67735854" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwSHR0R1lNallDbUJxVkF3MFlMa3A4UDZoSWoucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>008 从战后独立到去斯大林化，哥穆尔卡与波兰的十年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63c88556531dadd2b1566cf6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63c88556531dadd2b1566cf6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Jan 2023 23:48:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>二战结束后，战时的「四个波兰」要协商建立一个独立的新波兰，哥穆尔卡带领波兰工人党在国内大选中获胜，建立了亲苏联的社会主义政权。然而没多久，随着斯大林逝世，社会主义阵营局势骤变，面对着国内外波谲云诡的环境，波兰的社会矛盾已在爆发边缘。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期播客中，鹅塘主将探讨这样一个问题，冷战中的波兰等东欧国家是苏联的傀儡国吗？还或是拥有一定自己独立意志的政治实体？在五十年代那场席卷整个东欧的政治风暴中，波兰何以能够有惊无险地度过，并最终完成去斯大林化？</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>= 嘉宾 =</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>LSE 历史学硕士 芝加哥大学在读 &nbsp;&nbsp;鹅塘主</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>= 题图 =</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><em><span>Time</span></em><span> 杂志 1956 年 12 月刊封面</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 配乐 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Mazurek Dąbrowskiego by Central Band of the Polish Armed Forces</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Polonaise in A-flat major, Op. 53</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Soviet Victory </span></em><span>from</span><em><span> Hearts of Iron IV soundtrack</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Warszawianka</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Mury</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>God Save Poland</span></em></p><span></span><h2><span>= 时轴 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 二战中的「四个波兰」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a> 战后波兰的建立与哥穆尔卡的上台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a> 哥书记被撤职</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 斯大林之死后莫斯科的震荡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a> 贝鲁特突发心梗后奥哈布上台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1389">23:09</a> 波兹南事件爆发后哥书记再上台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 哥书记新政，波兰完成去斯大林化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1934">32:14</a> 其他东欧国家的去斯大林化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 为什么波匈两国受到斯大林之死冲击最大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2239">37:19</a> 结尾</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lt0UbXQ-4nWcwR3wQM7twkfSiaYW.m4a" length="59899807" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZsLXRWUGlUYmY1WG83STAzd0UzY1QyMG5fODUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
