  <item>
    <title>007 进博物馆前你要懂点古埃及语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63974420a5a6021fd6387344</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63974420a5a6021fd6387344</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Dec 2022 15:09:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1822 年，法国天才语言学家商博良终于通过罗塞塔石碑破解了古埃及文。值此二百周年之际，大英博物馆专门策划了「圣书字：解密古埃及」的特展以纪念这一历史性发现。此外，今年也是考古学家在帝王谷意外发现图坦卡蒙墓的一百周年。本期我们邀请了利物浦大学埃及学硕士、古埃及语学习者练习人老师做客「罗素广场」，与大家一同分享这门消亡两千年的古语言原本面貌，以及商博良如何通过一块黑色石碑打开了紧锁的古埃及文明的大门。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中你会了解到，古埃及人如何通过墙壁上 emoji 一样的画符记录口中的语言？「圣书字」「僧侣体」和「世俗体」在古埃及人的生活中都扮演了怎样的功用？为什么说商博良和罗塞塔石碑在现代考古学乃至大众文化中都占据了一席之地？为什么图坦卡蒙墓被发现时让所有人都惊到了下巴？作为普通人，有哪些进博物馆看埃及文物时的小 tips？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 嘉宾 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>利物浦大学埃及学硕士、博客「古埃及练习曲」博主、古埃及语学习者 练习人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 题图 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《死者之书》中的奥西里斯</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 时轴 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a> 古埃及语长什么样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 亲缘关系、消亡，与科普特语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> 现代英语中的古埃及语词汇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="959">15:59</a> 语言特征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 古埃及文字是象形文字吗？圣书体、僧侣体和世俗体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">30:43</a> 商博良与罗塞塔石碑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2557">42:37</a> 古埃及语的学习建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2912">48:32</a> 图坦卡蒙墓的发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3127">52:07</a> 片尾</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 配乐 =</span></h2><span></span><p><em><span>Cleopatra Theme music</span></em><span> from </span><em><span>Sid Meier’s Civilization soundtrack</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Hathor; Osiris; Lost Tombs</span></em><span> from </span><em><span>Ancient Egypt</span></em><span> by Derek Fiechter &amp; Brandon Fiechter</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Beethoven Symphony No. 3 in E Flat, Op. 55 - Eroica - 4. Finale (Allegro molto)</span></em><span> by Herbert von Karajan</span></p><span></span><p><span>some untitled music from</span><em><span> The Pharaohs’ Golden Parade</span></em><span> by Amira Selim</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 推荐阅读 =</span></h2><span></span><p><em><span>How To Read Egyptian Hieroglyphs: A Step By Step Guide To Teach Yourself </span></em><span>by Bill Manley &amp; Mark Collier</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>《古埃及圣书字导读》</span></em><span>（其实这本书是上边一本的中译版）</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Middle Egyptian: An Introduction to the Language and Culture of Hieroglyphs, 3rd ed.</span></em><span> by James Peter Allen</span></p><span></span><p><span>「古埃及练习曲」博客 </span><a href="https://practiceegyptian.com/" data-url="https://practiceegyptian.com/"><span>practiceegyptian.com</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>= 勘误 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a> 1822 年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1861">31:01</a>次日再次请教室友，感觉我法语读成这个鬼样子，说是我自己杜撰的更合理些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a>世俗体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2757">45:57</a> 发现这本中文书其实就是刚才那本的中译版</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llPl7Xuecl3S8MawYHTCl3w7OiOC.m4a" length="80080141" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvSkZGajZYZ3J0dS0tWExseExlSWdmWDlBRXYucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>006 古董业拍案惊奇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/636419262e925d51c1194859</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">636419262e925d51c1194859</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Nov 2022 19:40:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2019 年，一款乾隆时期的壁瓶在北京一场拍卖会上以两千多万人民币的价格成交，而当这位英国卖家最早以不到一英镑的价格淘到这件瓷器时，他对手中珍品的价值一无所知。</span></p><span></span><p><span>罗素广场本期请来两位青年古董艺术品从业者，为我们揭秘古董业的一角。现代古董业和中国传统古董业有多少传承？「掌眼」「打眼」这些行话都是什么意思？怎样的一群人在从事古董行业？作为在伦敦交易中国瓷器的专家，他们又如何看待今天世界市场上的中国古代艺术品？</span></p><span></span><p><span>注：伦敦亚洲艺术周 10.30-11.8</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 题图 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>元青花鬼谷子下山图罐</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 配乐 =</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>金蛇狂舞</span></strong><span> by 新竹青年國樂團</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>红颜劫</span></strong><span> by 姚贝娜</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>All the Things You Are</span></strong><span> by </span><em><span>Chet Baker</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>注：片头片尾曲由本期二位嘉宾钦点</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 时轴 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">04:41</a> 所谓一些古董业「行话」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="779">12:59</a> 怎么就进了这一行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 古董业的三类人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1364">22:44</a> 瓷器鉴定在看什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 古董的门类有哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 文物和古董的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> 在中国，什么样的文物可以交易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> 卢芹斋的正背面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2746">45:46</a> 从事古董业都在做哪些工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3292">54:52</a> 世界市场上的中国古董</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4160">1:09:20</a> 为什么中国古董不太行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4724">1:18:44</a> 片尾</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 勘误 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 不是贾樟柯，是贾平凹。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 不是「大朝奉」，是「老朝奉」。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrlpvXPW7Zdj8j6DGwbbK5h-hf7G.m4a" length="122569608" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:24:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvZl81eXZENlF1U1ZERlFkYlZERzV1cGt2UWoucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
