  <item>
    <title>005 一九三五，让世界重新认识中国</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634fed129186d4e4c46a14da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">634fed129186d4e4c46a14da</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Oct 2022 12:26:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>抗日战争全面爆发的前夕，一千多件中国文物在上海被成箱装上一艘英国军舰，准备送往伦敦。这些文物来自故宫博物院、中央研究院等全国各大机构，其中不乏国宝级艺术品。它们将在英国皇家艺术学院参与一场名为「伦敦中国艺术国际展览会」的特展。随行的还有六位非常年轻的中国工作人员，此行不仅要向欧美推广中国文化，更担负着向世界展示一个现代进步的少年中国的形象，为即将爆发的战争博取世界同情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>策展消息在国内传开后，在国内却招致舆论界的一致反对，包括梁思成、林徽因、朱自清、金岳霖等在内的三十余位学术名流发表公开信，认为将文物送往国外此举无异于狼入户口。最后这场展览如何克服重重困难开展？这样一场展览如何让世界为之侧目？展览结束后，一千余件中国文物又将面临怎样的命运？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 本期嘉宾 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>诺丁汉大学艺术史博士候选人 张露</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 本期使用配乐 =</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>Grazing the Horse</span></em><span> by Zhao Cong</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>Palace Memories</span></em><span> by S.E.N.S</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>Summer Palace</span></em><span> by Kong Hongwei</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>= 时轴 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 1935 年伦敦国际中国艺术博览会是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">05:56</a> 谁来推动这场展览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> 在国内的筹划过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a> 参会的文物们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">28:53</a> 展览结束后文物命运如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 傅振伦的伦敦见闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">38:22</a> 观展过的国内外名流们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a> 这样一场展览如何在历史中留下印记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">57:06</a> 建国以来的文物回流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3543">59:03</a> 片尾</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 推荐阅读 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《伦敦中国艺展始末》 傅振伦</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkn08oAdncik8_N__RrCCJOZQg3M.m4a" length="92610669" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqVEZzWkRTMWhzbjd2V3EzQUZYbzI4Z194Vk4ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>004 高句丽，我们不知道的还很多</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632a4a63ca79f70db275b20e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">632a4a63ca79f70db275b20e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Sep 2022 23:18:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从西汉末到唐朝初年，高句丽立国于辽东长达七百年，从汉朝边疆的羁縻部族成长为东亚举足轻重的辉煌文明。国灭之后，她的名字更是留在朝韩二国的国名中至今。然而除去史书中语焉不详的记载外，她留给我们今天遐思的只有遍布东北和朝鲜半岛的一座座巨大石墓和出土材料上的只言片语。透过厚厚的历史迷雾，这座古国的面貌却越来越晦暗不清。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目邀请了曾做客「罗素广场」001 期奥斯曼土耳其主题的刘全适担任特邀主持，由我为大家分享对高句丽历史的一些粗浅了解。从高句丽民族的起源、「高句丽」一名的由来，到她最后在隋唐两大帝国的征伐中最终覆灭，再到她的语言与文化。当我们提及高句丽时，可以不只是争论她的今日归属问题。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 特邀主持 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>@刘全适</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>= 题图 =</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>舞踊墓内壁画 高句丽骑射图</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 配乐 =</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>The Kingdom of the Winds </span></em><span>from</span><em><span> The Kingdom of the Winds OST</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>Samul Nori</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>March on </span></em><span>from </span><em><span>The Kingdom of the Winds OST</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>公无渡河歌</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>千年回眸 </span></em><span>by 徐鲤</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>= 时轴 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 为什么对高句丽感兴趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 高句丽简历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 传世史料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> 好太王碑和其他文物史料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 「高句丽」之名从何而来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a> 王城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">24:02</a> 汉四郡与高句丽兴起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> 建国神话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2094">34:54</a> 隋唐对高句丽的征服战争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 高句丽语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2413">40:13</a> 壁画与诗歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2635">43:55</a> 历史争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2909">48:29</a> 听个歌儿</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 勘误 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2589">43:09</a> 津卒的名字叫「霍里子高」</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsJbHdqVnQO_jXJJMMMXMCfL2ifG.m4a" length="72889417" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzQ0JGTEpaNEhNU1hmLUk3bDd0dnB1TlRSQnIucG5n.png"/>
