    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>= 嘉宾 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>LSE 人类学硕士、城市修道人 李小二</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 配乐 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《迎仙客》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《云水禅心》 from 掬水 by 王森地</span></p><span></span><p><span>《太上老君说常清静经》</span></p><span></span><h2><span>= 时轴 =</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 如何接触了修道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> 「道家」和「道教」的异同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 全真道和正一道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a> 什么是修行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a> 占卜与祝尤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> 如何调和与唯物主义世界观的矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2444">40:44</a> 普通人能做怎样的练习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2837">47:17</a> 听个歌</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2>]]></description>
